{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 4, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "公", "id": "公"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "在", "id": "在"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "性", "id": "性"}, {"form": "敬", "id": "敬"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "用", "id": "用"}, {"form": "盡", "id": "盡"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "辟", "id": "辟"}, {"form": "遊", "id": "遊"}, {"form": "長", "id": "長"}, {"form": "門", "id": "門"}], "edges": [{"weight": 4.253245844807957, "source": "門", "target": "遊"}, {"weight": 2.8669514836880663, "source": "門", "target": "在"}, {"weight": 2.8669514836880663, "source": "門", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.579269411236285, "source": "在", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 3.2724165917962305, "source": "公", "target": "敬"}, {"weight": 1.8861222306763399, "source": "公", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 3.2724165917962305, "source": "公", "target": "盡"}, {"weight": 3.2724165917962305, "source": "公", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 4.658710952916121, "source": "公", "target": "辟"}, {"weight": 1.1929750501163947, "source": "敬", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.579269411236285, "source": "敬", "target": "盡"}, {"weight": 2.579269411236285, "source": "敬", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 3.5600986642480112, "source": "敬", "target": "長"}, {"weight": 1.8861222306763399, "source": "敬", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.6141885151926982, "source": "君子", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 0.22789415407280755, "source": "君子", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.0751920144600111, "source": "君子", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.4806571225681755, "source": "君子", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 0.7875099420082302, "source": 